ad of `*parser.Task`.\n- `formatDebugContext` should take string instead of `*parser.DebugInfo`.\n\nActually, these functions in `doing_prompt.go` (`GenerateDoingPrompt`, `GenerateDoingPromptFile`, `formatTaskInfoSection`, `formatDebugContext`) — are they even used anymore? Let me check who calls them.\n\nThe builder's `pibuilder.go` uses `prompt.GeneratePlanPromptFile`, `prompt.GenerateDreamPromptFile`, `prompt.GenerateCtrlPromptFile`, `prompt.GenerateHumanLoopPromptFile`, `prompt.EnsurePromptsDir`, `prompt.WriteSkillFile`, `prompt.LoadLoopsContext`, `prompt.LoadSkillsContext`, `prompt.LoadCoreSkills`, `prompt.NewPromptManager`, `prompt.NewPromptBuilder`.\n\nThe `SaveDoingPrompt` in pibuilder.go directly uses `prompt.NewPromptBuilder` + template, NOT `prompt.GenerateDoingPromptFile`. So `prompt.GenerateDoingPromptFile` and `GenerateDoingPrompt` might be dead code now (only used by executor.runner.go which is being deleted, and by tests).\n\nLet me verify: grep for GenerateDoingPromptFile and GenerateDoingPrompt usage.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_zzhwuchZKNZUX9cvarXm1473","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick && echo \"=== GenerateDoingPrompt / GenerateDoingPromptFile usage ===\" && grep -rn \"GenerateDoingPrompt\\|GenerateDoingPromptFile\" --include='*.go' internal/ cmd/ pkg/ && echo \"=== formatTaskInfoSection / formatDebugContext usage ===\" && grep -rn \"formatTaskInfoSection\\|formatDebugContext\" --include='*.go' internal/ cmd/ pkg/ && echo \"=== GenerateEasyPromptFile / GenerateEasyPrompt usage ===\" && grep -rn \"GenerateEasyPromptFile\\|GenerateEasyPrompt\\b\" --include='*.go' internal/ cmd/ pkg/"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1006,"output":1002,"cacheRead":128128,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":812,"totalTokens":130136,"cost":{"input":0.00043761,"output":0.0008717400000000001,"cacheRead":0.00046446400000000004,"cac