{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"thinking_end","contentIndex":0,"content":"All target packages pass. Now let me handle the remaining items:\n\n1. **helper.py** — fill in real gate logic.\n2. **templates** — doing.md (done), plan.md step 8, skills/doing_loop.md, and 6 templates act-path → trace.\n3. **skills/loops** — update check_mechanism, mark_task_success, failure_feedback skills, do-check-mark-success-loop, README indexes.\n\nLet me first do the helper.py (most critical for the test).\n\nThe test requires:\n1. `success` but commit_hash empty → \"missing commit_hash\" + exit non-0.\n2. unparseable tasks.json → exit non-0.\n3. zombie running → exit non-0.\n4. valid doing dir (success + commit_hash) → exit 0.\n\nAlso the test checks `helper_src` — if 'placeholder' in src and 'missing commit_hash' not in src → error. So I must remove \"placeholder\" and include \"missing commit_hash\".\n\nLet me write helper.py:\n\n```python\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"rick-gates 门禁 helper — 确定性 doing 门禁校验。\"\"\"\nimport json\nimport os\nimport sys\n\ndef main(argv):\n    if len(argv) < 2:\n        print(\"usage: helper.py <doing_dir>\", file=sys.stderr)\n        return 2\n    doing_dir = argv[1]\n    tasks_json_path = os.path.join(doing_dir, \"tasks.json\")\n    try:\n        with open(tasks_json_path, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n            data = json.load(f)\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"tasks.json 不可解析: {e}\", file=sys.stderr)\n        return 1\n    tasks = data.get(\"tasks\", [])\n    if not isinstance(tasks, list):\n        print(\"tasks.json 缺少 tasks 数组\", file=sys.stderr)\n        return 1\n    for task in tasks:\n        task_id = task.get(\"task_id\", \"?\")\n        status = task.get(\"status\", \"\")\n        if status == \"running\":\n            print(f\"zombie running: task {task_id} 仍处于 running 状态\", file=sys.stderr)\n            return 1\n        if status == \"success\":\n            commit_hash = task.get(\"commit_hash\", \"\")\n            if not commit_hash:\n                print(f\"missing commit_hash: task {task_id} 状态为 success 但 commit_hash 为空\", file=sys.stderr)\n                return 1\n    print(\"gate passed\")\n    return 0\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    sys.exit(main(sys.argv))\n```\n\nWait, the test for zombie running: tasks.json has one task `{\"task_id\": \"task1\", \"task_name\": \"t1\", \"status\": \"running\"}` with no commit_hash. My code checks running first → returns 1 with \"zombie running\". Good.\n\nThe test for valid: `{\"task_id\": \"task1\", \"task_name\": \"t1\", \"status\": \"success\", \"commit_hash\": \"abc123def456\"}` → returns 0. Good.\n\nThe test for unparseable: writes `{ not valid json` → json.load fails → returns 1. Good.\n\nThe test for missing commit_hash: `{\"task_id\": \"task1\", \"task_name\": \"t1\", \"status\": \"success\"}` → success without commit_hash → \"missing commit_hash\" + return 1. Good.\n\nAlso the \"placeholder\" check: my new file has no \"placeholder\". And \"missing commit_hash\" is present. Good.\n\nLet me write it."}}
{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"toolcall_end","contentIndex":1,"toolCall":{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_ToEajqnzjwJeOIWkuAEj1289","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/.rick/skills/rick-gates/helper.py","content":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n# Description: rick-gates 门禁 helper — 确定性 doing 门禁校验。\n\n\"\"\"rick-gates 门禁 helper — 确定性 doing 门禁校验。\n\nrick 侧确定性脚本（非 pi extension hook，hook 仅作通知/记录）。runtime.Run 在解析到\nagent_settled（pi 会话结束）后直接调用本脚本校验 doing 门禁，exit 非 0 = 门禁失败。\n\n校验语义（与原 doing_check 三项语义对齐）：\n1. tasks.json 可解析 —— doing/tasks.json 是合法 JSON 且含 tasks 数组。\n2. zombie 检测 —— 无遗留 running 状态任务。\n3. commit_hash 存在 —— status=success 的任务必须有非空 commit_hash。\n\n用法：python3 helper.py <doing_dir>\n\"\"\"\n\nimport json\nimport os\nimport sys\n\n\ndef main(argv):\n    if len(argv) < 2:\n        print(\"usage: helper.py <doing_dir>\", file=sys.stderr)\n        return 2\n\n    doing_dir = argv[1]\n    tasks_json_path = os.path.join(doing_dir, \"tasks.json\")\n\n    # 1. tasks.json 可解析\n    try:\n        with open(tasks_json_path, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n            data = json.load(f)\n    except Exception as e:  # noqa: BLE001 - 门禁错误串需兼容任意解析失败\n        print(\"tasks.json 不可解析: %s\" % e, file=sys.stderr)\n        return 1\n\n    tasks = data.get(\"tasks\")\n    if not isinstance(tasks, list):\n        print(\"tasks.json 缺少 tasks 数组\", file=sys.stderr)\n        return 1\n\n    for task in tasks:\n        task_id = task.get(\"task_id\", \"?\")\n        status = task.get(\"status\", \"\")\n\n        # 2. zombie 检测\n        if status == \"running\":\n            print(\"zombie running: task %s 仍处于 running 状态\" % task_id, file=sys.stderr)\n            return 1\n\n        # 3. commit_hash 存在\n        if status == \"success\":\n            commit_hash = task.get(\"commit_hash\", \"\")\n            if not commit_hash:\n                print(\"missing commit_hash: task %s 状态为 success 但 commit_hash 为空\" % task_id, file=sys.st