th-` → `trace-`\n3. `act-path` → `runtime trace`\n\nActually order matters. Let me just replace \"act-path\" with \"runtime-trace\" globally in the 6 files. That yields \"runtime-trace.md\", \"runtime-trace-{taskID}.md\", \"从 runtime-trace 提取\". That's acceptable and unambiguous.\n\nBut wait, \"act-path\" is part of \"act_path_files\"? No, \"act_path_files\" uses underscore, not hyphen, so sed on \"act-path\" won't touch it. Good.\n\nLet me do the sed on the 6 files."}}
