{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The grep searched `.rick/` which contains historical job data (jobs/job_18, draft, RFC, dream logs). These are historical artifacts, not source templates. The test only checks the 6 template files. So I don't need to touch those historical files.\n\nThe important thing: the 6 templates (in internal/prompt/templates/) no longer have \"act-path\". Let me verify the test's exact file list doesn't include `.rick/` files.\n\nThe test's `actpath_templates` list:\n- internal/prompt/templates/dream.md\n- internal/prompt/templates/learning.md\n- internal/prompt/templates/ctrl.md\n- internal/prompt/templates/skills/gen-loop.md\n- internal/prompt/templates/skills/gen-skill.md\n- internal/prompt/templates/skills/learning_loop.md\n\nAll 6 are in internal/prompt/templates/. I've updated all. Good.\n\nThe remaining \"act-path\" references in `.rick/` historical files are irrelevant (and the task doesn't require cleaning those; they're historical data/dream logs).\n\nNow let me handle the skills/loops maintenance (KR8):\n1. `.rick/skills/check_mechanism_skill/skill.md` — remove doing_check/plan_check sections, keep learning_check.\n2. `.rick/skills/mark_task_success_skill/skill.md` — remove doing_check section.\n3. `.rick/skills/failure_feedback_skill/skill.md` — remove internal/executor/retry.go reference.\n4. `.rick/loops/do-check-mark-success-loop.md` — move to deprecated or mark invalid.\n5. Update loops/README.md, skills/README.md indexes.\n\nThese are not checked by the test, but the task requires them. Let me read these files.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_mCMiv1qV52wyccMKiS0W9290","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/.rick/skills/check_mechanism_skill/skill.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_vvB2JNFuWFTRuCwF4B1k1721","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/.rick/skills/mark_task_success_skill/skill.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_02_iKgtPTb4XBmh5ktdHCVn2140","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/.rick/skills/failure_feedback_skill/skill.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":12393,"output":574,"cacheRead":230912,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":387,"totalTokens":243879,"cost":{"input":0.005390955,"output":0.00049938,"cacheRead":0.0008370560000000001,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.006727391}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786913161163,"responseId":"feb6c137-107e-422d-bc42-8eeab79d88e6","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_mCMiv1qV52wyccMKiS0W9290","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# skill:check-mechanism（Check 机制工作原理）\n\n## 触发场景\n\nplan/doing/learning_check 命令失败，需要理解失败原因或扩展新检查规则时使用。\n\n## 预期效果\n\n- 能读懂 check 失败输出，精准修复\n- 能扩展新 check 规则而不破坏现有规则\n- 每次运行 check 后能判断是否需要重新 commit\n\n## 核心内容\n\n### 三个 check 命令和各自验证内容\n\n| 命令 | 验证内容 | 通过条件 |\n|------|--------|--------|\n| `rick tools plan_check job_N` | tasks.json 存在；tasks/*.md 格式正确 | exit code 0，输出 `✅ PASS` |\n| `rick tools doing_check job_N` | tasks.json 可解析；debug/bug*.md 格式 | exit code 0，输出 `✅ PASS` |\n| `rick tools learning_check job_N` | SUMMARY.md 非空且含 `# Job` 标题 | exit code 0，输出 `✅ PASS` |\n\n### 手动运行\n\n```bash\n# 优先使用本地构建版（含当前代码）\n./bin/rick tools doing_check job_N\n./bin/rick tools plan_check job_N\n./bin/rick tools learning_check job_N\n```\n\n### check 失败时的修复流程\n\n1. 读取失败输出，定位具体 check 项\n2. 修复对应文件（tasks.json / debug/bug*.md / SUMMARY.md）\n3. 如果是 tasks.json 状态问题 → 参考 [mark_task_success_skill](../mark_task_success_skill/skill.md)\n4. 修复后重新提交 + 再次运行 check\n\n### doing_check 常见失败原因\n\n| 失败信息 | 原因 | 修复 |\n|---------|------|------|\n| `task status != success` | tasks.json 中 task 未标记完成 | 运行 `mark_task_success.py` |\n| `commit_hash is empty` | tasks.json 中缺少 commit_hash | 补充 git rev-parse HEAD 的结果 |\n| `debug format error` | bug*.md frontmatter 不完整 | 检查 frontmatter 含 title/status/summary |\n\n### 扩展新 check 规则\n\n在对应的 `internal/cmd/tools_*_check.go` 文件的 `run*Check()` 函数末尾追加：\n\n```go\n// 新增：检查某文件存在性\nxPath := filepath.Join(jobDir, \"X.md\")\nif _, err := os.Stat(xPath); os.IsNotExist(err) {\n    errors = append(errors, fmt.Sprintf(\"X.md not found: %s\", xPath))\n}\n```\n\n同步更新 `write*CheckFixPrompt` 函数，加入新检查项的修复说明。\n\n构建后验证：`./scripts/build.sh && ./bin/rick tools doing_check job_N`\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786913170321},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_01_vvB2JNFuWFTRuCwF4B1k1721","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# skill:mark-task-success（tasks.json 两阶段提交）\n\n## 触发场景\n\ndoing task 代码已提交（有 commit hash）但 doing_check 报错：\n- `task status != success`\n- `task status=success but commit_hash is empty`\n\n信号词：`doing_check` 输出 `task status` 相关错误。\n\n## 预期效果\n\n- 一次修复通过 doing_check\n- 不需要反复读取 tasks.json 格式或 check 源码\n\n## 核心内容\n\n### 使用辅助脚本（推荐）\n\n```bash\n# 代码已 commit 后，立即执行：\npython3 .rick/skills/mark_task_success_skill/mark_task_success.py --job job_N --task taskX\n# 工具自动读取 HEAD commit hash，更新 tasks.json status=success + commit_hash\n\n# 提交 tasks.json：\ngit add .rick/jobs/job_N/doing/tasks.json\ngit commit -m \"chore(taskX): mark taskX success in tasks.json\"\n\n# 验证：\n./bin/rick tools doing_check job_N  # 应输出 ✅ PASS\n```\n\n### 手动修复（备用）\n\n```python\nimport json, subprocess\n\n# 获取 commit hash\nhash_result = subprocess.run([\"git\", \"rev-parse\", \"HEAD\"], capture_output=True, text=True)\ncommit_hash = hash_result.stdout.strip()\n\n# 更新 tasks.json\nwith open(\".rick/jobs/job_N/doing/tasks.json\", \"r\") as f:\n    data = json.load(f)\n\nfor task in data[\"tasks\"]:\n    if task[\"task_id\"] == \"taskX\":\n        task[\"status\"] = \"success\"\n        task[\"commit_hash\"] = commit_hash\n        break\n\nwith open(\".rick/jobs/job_N/doing/tasks.json\", \"w\") as f:\n    json.dump(data, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n```\n\n### 最优执行序（避免二次失败）\n\n1. 完成代码变更 → `git commit` → 记录 commit hash\n2. `python3 .rick/skills/mark_task_success_skill/mark_task_success.py --job job_N --task taskX`\n3. `git add tasks.json && git commit -m \"chore(taskX): mark success\"`\n4. `./bin/rick tools doing_check job_N`（此时必过）\n\n### tasks.json 结构说明\n\n```json\n{\n  \"tasks\": [\n    {\n      \"task_id\": \"task1\",\n      \"status\": \"success\",\n      \"commit_hash\": \"40位SHA\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-07-02T...\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n`status=success` + `commit_hash` 非空 → doing_check 通过。\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786913170321},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_02_iKgtPTb4XBmh5ktdHCVn2140","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# skill:failure-feedback（失败信息传递机制）\n\n## 触发场景\n\ndoing 阶段 task 失败重试时，需要理解或调整失败信息如何传递给下一轮 Agent 时使用。\n\n## 预期效果\n\n- 下一轮 Agent 能看到上一轮的完整错误输出（含 traceback/stderr）\n- prompt 不因重试次数增加而无限膨胀（最多保留最近 2 次，3000 字符上限）\n\n## 核心内容\n\n### 失败信息流转\n\n```\nExecuteTestScript 返回 testOutput\n    → RunTask 构造 result.Error（含 Full test output: ...）\n    → RetryTask 生成 \"=== Attempt N ===\\n{error}\" 条目\n    → appendFailureFeedback（最近2条，3000字符）\n    → GenerateDoingPromptFile 注入 testErrorFeedback\n    → 下一轮 Claude Agent\n```\n\n### appendFailureFeedback 算法\n\n- 按 `=== Attempt ` 分割现有条目\n- 追加新条目，只保留最近 `maxEntries`（默认 2）条\n- 合并后超 `maxBytes`（默认 3000）时从尾部截断，对齐到行边界\n\n### 调试：查看传递给下一轮的 prompt\n\ndoing prompt 执行后默认被删除。临时调试时注释掉 runner.go 中的删除逻辑：\n```go\n// defer os.Remove(doingPromptFile)  // 注释以保留文件\n```\n\n### 调整参数（internal/executor/retry.go）\n\n```go\n// 保留最近条数（默认2）和字符上限（默认3000）\ntestErrorFeedback = appendFailureFeedback(testErrorFeedback, newEntry, 2, 3000)\n```\n\n### 为什么完整 testOutput 重要\n\n旧版（500字符截断）agent 只能看到：\n```\ntest did not pass: assertion failed; key not found\n```\n\n新版 agent 能看到：\n```\ntest did not pass: assertion failed; key not found\nFull test output:\nAssertionError: OKR.md not found at .rick/jobs/job_1/plan/OKR.md\n{\"pass\": false, \"errors\": [\"assertion failed\"]}\n```\n\n文件路径和行号直接可见，修复效率大幅提升。\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786913170321}]}
