ate passed\")\n    return 0\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    sys.exit(main(sys.argv))\n```\n\nWait, the test for zombie running: tasks.json has one task `{\"task_id\": \"task1\", \"task_name\": \"t1\", \"status\": \"running\"}` with no commit_hash. My code checks running first → returns 1 with \"zombie running\". Good.\n\nThe test for valid: `{\"task_id\": \"task1\", \"task_name\": \"t1\", \"status\": \"success\", \"commit_hash\": \"abc123def456\"}` → returns 0. Good.\n\nThe test for unparseable: writes `{ not valid json` → json.load fails → returns 1. Good.\n\nThe test for missing commit_hash: `{\"task_id\": \"task1\", \"task_name\": \"t1\", \"status\": \"success\"}` → success without commit_hash → \"missing commit_hash\" + return 1. Good.\n\nAlso the \"placeholder\" check: my new file has no \"placeholder\". And \"missing commit_hash\" is present. Good.\n\nLet me write it.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_ToEajqnzjwJeOIWkuAEj1289","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/.rick/skills/rick-gates/helper.py","content":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n# Description: rick-gates 门禁 helper — 确定性 doing 门禁校验。\n\n\"\"\"rick-gates 门禁 helper — 确定性 doing 门禁校验。\n\nrick 侧确定性脚本（非 pi extension hook，hook 仅作通知/记录）。runtime.Run 在解析到\nagent_settled（pi 会话结束）后直接调用本脚本校验 doing 门禁，exit 非 0 = 门禁失败。\n\n校验语义（与原 doing_check 三项语义对齐）：\n1. tasks.json 可解析 —— doing/tasks.json 是合法 JSON 且含 tasks 数组。\n2. zombie 检测 —— 无遗留 running 状态任务。\n3. commit_hash 存在 —— status=success 的任务必须有非空 commit_hash。\n\n用法：python3 helper.py <doing_dir>\n\"\"\"\n\nimport json\nimport os\nimport sys\n\n\ndef main(argv):\n    if len(argv) < 2:\n        print(\"usage: helper.py <doing_dir>\", file=sys.stderr)\n        return 2\n\n    doing_dir = argv[1]\n    tasks_json_path = os.path.join(doing_dir, \"tasks.json\")\n\n    # 1. tasks.json 可解析\n    try:\n        with open(tasks_json_path, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n            data = json.load(f)\n    except Exception as e:  # noqa: BLE001 - 门禁错误串需兼容任意解析失败\n        print(\"tasks.json 不可解析: %s\" % e, file=sys.stderr)\n        return 1\n\n    tasks = data.get(\"tasks\")\n    if not isinstance(tasks, list):\n        print(\"tasks.json 缺少 tasks 数组\", file=sys.stderr)\n        return 1\n\n    for task in tasks:\n        task_id = task.get(\"task_id\", \"?\")\n        status = task.get(\"status\", \"\")\n\n        # 2. zombie 检测\n        if status == \"running\":\n            print(\"zombie running: task %s 仍处于 running 状态\" % task_id, file=sys.stderr)\n            return 1\n\n        # 3. commit_hash 存在\n        if status == \"success\":\n            commit_hash = task.get(\"commit_hash\", \"\")\n            if not commit_hash:\n                print(\"missing commit_hash: task %s 状态为 success 但 commit_hash 为空\" % task_id, file=sys.stderr)\n                return 1\n\n    print(\"gate passed\")\n    return 0\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    sys.exit(main(sys.argv))\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":278,"output":1424,"cacheRead":223360,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":784,"totalTokens":225062,"cost":{"input":0.00012093000000000001,"output":0.0012388800000000001,"cacheRead":0.00080968,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00216949}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786913084960,"responseId":"aaea925d-ba65-4aba-989d-a22aa5597608","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_ToEajqnzjwJeOIWkuAEj1289","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully wrote 1758 bytes to /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/.rick/skills/rick-gates/helper.py"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786913099034},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me test the helper.py manually.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_ndh1HkBvjC1P9aX6M6bE3177","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick && python3 .rick/skills/rick-gat